# (The `!waveflow/build/` and `!**/guide/build/headless_output.txt` negations that used to live here
# are gone: they existed only to undo the unanchored `build/` rules, which are now targeted.)

# XSI simulation build output (xelab): xsim.dir/<top>/xsimk.dll + the work/*.sdb it compiles from.
# Regenerated by every `pytest -m xsi` run, so tracking it churns ~2.3MB per run. These were swept in
# by a `git add -A` during the mem_copy split (ce109d6), not by intent.
examples/*/xsi/xsim.dir/
examples/*/xsi/*.log
examples/*/xsi/*.jou
examples/*/xsi/*.pb
examples/*/xsi/.Xil/

# Generated XSI test-vector bundles (written at gate time; data is *.bin, ignored above).
examples/*/xsi/vectors/
